    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Happy Vibes | 3BR Inlet Beach Getaway with Private Pickleball Court & Outdoor Oasis<br><br>Welcome to Happy Vibes—a fun, stylish 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom retreat located just minutes from the sugar-white sands of 30A. This thoughtfully designed home combines laid-back luxury with resort-style amenities, including your very own private pickleball court, creating the ultimate beach escape for families, couples, or groups of friends.<br><br>Why You’ll Love It Here<br><br>• Private Pickleball Court – A rare find! Challenge friends or family to a match without ever leaving the property.<br>• Outdoor Oasis – Relax in the fully fenced backyard featuring maintenance-free turf, a propane fire pit, grill, and comfortable lounge seating under string lights.<br>• Kid-Friendly Fun – Includes a toddler playground in the backyard and open space for play.<br>• Extras for Adventure – Comes with four adult cruiser bikes and a paddleboard for exploring the area on land or water.<br>• Open & Airy Living – The spacious main floor features comfortable seating, stylish décor, and plenty of natural light.<br>• Fully Stocked Kitchen – Equipped with modern appliances and everything you need to prepare meals with ease.<br>• Ideal Location – Just a quick drive or bike ride to the beach, restaurants, and shops of 30A.<br><br>Designed for Relaxation<br><br>• Comfortably Sleeps 10 Adults + 2 Kids – Includes a king master suite, guest bedrooms with queen bed, bunk beds and a small sleeper sofa perfect for younger guests.<br>• Modern Essentials – Stay connected with fast Wi-Fi, and enjoy the convenience of a washer and dryer.<br>• Family-Ready – Thoughtfully designed to offer space for everyone to hang out, play, and unwind in style.<br><br>Happy Vibes at a Glance<br><br>• 3 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Sleeps Up to 10 Adults + 2 Kids<br>• Private Pickleball Court<br>• Fully Fenced Turf Yard with Toddler Playground<br>• Propane Grill, Fire Pit & Lounge Area<br>• 4 Cruiser Bikes + 1 Paddleboard<br>• Fully Equipped Kitchen<br>• Free Wi-Fi<br>• Washer & Dryer<br>• Smart TVs<br><br>⸻<br><br>Distance to Airports:<br>• Panama City (ECP): 21 mi | 30 min<br>• Destin-Ft. Walton (VPS): 49 mi | 1 hr 20 min<br>• Pensacola (PNS): 110 mi | 2 hr<br><br>About Us:<br>30A Sea Story is a locally owned and operated boutique management company dedicated to providing exceptional, personalized customer service. Whether you’re seeking insider tips from locals or prefer a more hands-off hosting experience, we let you take the lead while remaining readily available to enhance your stay.<br><br>Book now and catch the Happy Vibes on your next Beach vacation!<br>1. Please leave the sand at the beach. Sand damages floors, showers, and furnishings.<br><br>2. Do not operate the air conditioning with any doors or windows open as this can cause it to freeze and malfunction.<br><br>3. NO SMOKING. All 30A Sea Story properties are non-smoking. By renting our property it is understood that you will NOT smoke in our vacation rentals; guests will be charged a penalty fee if evidence of smoke is found upon checkout.<br><br>4. Please understand you and your guest(s) are using our home at your own risk. Neither 30A Sea Story, LLC nor the homeowner of the property will be held responsible for any injuries that occur at the vacation rental or for any lost or stolen items.<br><br>5. No boats or trailers are to be parked at 30A Sea Story properties. Any fines from the HOA as a result of this broken rule will be charged to the guest.<br><br>6. Do not move the furniture.<br><br>7. Please always wash and dry your belongings separately from our linens.",
